{#- Glifos geométricos dos quatro perfis e da esteira.

    SVG inline com currentColor: a cor vem da classe .warm ou .cool do
    contêiner, nunca do próprio desenho. São decorativos (aria-hidden): o texto
    ao lado já carrega o sentido.

    Um lugar só para os sete desenhos. Os três da esteira aparecem em dois
    arquivos (processo.njk e jornada.njk), e desenho colado em dois lugares
    diverge na primeira correção.

    Legibilidade, duas medidas que não mexem no desenho:

    1. viewBox recortado. Os originais ocupavam só o miolo de um quadro de
       200, e a 42px o desenho virava 17 a 24px. Cada viewBox abaixo é o
       menor quadrado centrado que contém o desenho mais meia espessura de
       traço e 3 unidades de folga, medido com getBBox. O --lado de cada svg
       é o lado desse quadrado.

    2. Traço mínimo de 1px. Cada stroke-width vira max(original, --min-u),
       e o CSS calcula --min-u como o tamanho de 1px em unidades do desenho
       (--lado dividido pelo tamanho da caixa). Traço grosso fica como está;
       traço que cairia abaixo de um pixel sobe até um. O atributo original
       continua lá como reserva para navegador sem max() em CSS.

       Não é vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke de propósito. Ele levaria os
       tracejados para pixel de tela e mudaria o desenho (a abertura do
       Visionário, o tracejado do Estrategista).

    Uso: {% from "glifos.njk" import glifo %} e depois {{ glifo("mapa") }} -#}

{%- macro glifo(nome) -%}
{%- if nome == "visionario" -%}
<svg viewBox="44.9 42 110.2 110.2" style="--lado: 110.2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="48" stroke-width="2.4" style="stroke-width: max(2.4, var(--min-u, 0))" stroke-dasharray="195 8"/>
  <circle cx="100" cy="52" r="7" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
</svg>
{%- elif nome == "executor" -%}
<svg viewBox="61 50 100 100" style="--lado: 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <line x1="95" y1="90" x2="75" y2="90" stroke-width="2" style="stroke-width: max(2, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".3"/>
  <line x1="95" y1="100" x2="65" y2="100" stroke-width="2" style="stroke-width: max(2, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".45"/>
  <line x1="95" y1="110" x2="75" y2="110" stroke-width="2" style="stroke-width: max(2, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".3"/>
  <path d="M158,100 L100,72 L118,100 L100,128 Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
</svg>
{%- elif nome == "guardiao" -%}
<svg viewBox="53.5 53.5 93 93" style="--lado: 93" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <polygon points="58,58 142,58 142,142 58,142" stroke-width="3" style="stroke-width: max(3, var(--min-u, 0))"/>
  <g opacity=".6" stroke-width="1.8" style="stroke-width: max(1.8, var(--min-u, 0))">
    <line x1="100" y1="58" x2="100" y2="72"/>
    <line x1="142" y1="100" x2="128" y2="100"/>
    <line x1="100" y1="142" x2="100" y2="128"/>
    <line x1="58" y1="100" x2="72" y2="100"/>
  </g>
  <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
</svg>
{%- elif nome == "estrategista" -%}
<svg viewBox="37.8 37.8 124.4 124.4" style="--lado: 124.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <polygon points="100,42 150,71 150,129 100,158 50,129 50,71" stroke-width="2.4" style="stroke-width: max(2.4, var(--min-u, 0))" stroke-dasharray="20 6"/>
  <g opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.4" style="stroke-width: max(1.4, var(--min-u, 0))" stroke-dasharray="3 4">
    <line x1="100" y1="100" x2="70" y2="55"/>
    <line x1="100" y1="100" x2="115" y2="48"/>
    <line x1="100" y1="100" x2="145" y2="65"/>
    <line x1="100" y1="100" x2="150" y2="110"/>
  </g>
  <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
</svg>
{%- elif nome == "mapa" -%}
<svg viewBox="11.5 16.3 177.4 177.4" style="--lado: 177.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <line x1="70" y1="20" x2="70" y2="190" stroke-width="1" style="stroke-width: max(1, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".28"/>
  <line x1="130" y1="20" x2="130" y2="190" stroke-width="1" style="stroke-width: max(1, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".28"/>
  <line x1="15" y1="70" x2="185" y2="70" stroke-width="1" style="stroke-width: max(1, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".28"/>
  <line x1="15" y1="130" x2="185" y2="130" stroke-width="1" style="stroke-width: max(1, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".28"/>
  <path d="M20,108 C50,93 80,118 110,98 C140,83 160,103 185,93" stroke-width="1.8" style="stroke-width: max(1.8, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".45"/>
  <circle cx="100" cy="150" r="14" stroke-width="1.4" style="stroke-width: max(1.4, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".55"/>
  <circle cx="100" cy="150" r="7" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
</svg>
{%- elif nome == "bussola" -%}
<svg viewBox="30.2 42 139.7 139.7" style="--lado: 139.7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <circle cx="100" cy="150" r="22" stroke-width="1.4" style="stroke-width: max(1.4, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".5"/>
  <g opacity=".5" stroke-width="1.4" style="stroke-width: max(1.4, var(--min-u, 0))">
    <line x1="122" y1="150" x2="128" y2="150"/>
    <line x1="115.5" y1="134.5" x2="120" y2="129"/>
    <line x1="100" y1="128" x2="100" y2="122"/>
    <line x1="84.5" y1="134.5" x2="80" y2="129"/>
    <line x1="78" y1="150" x2="72" y2="150"/>
    <line x1="84.5" y1="165.5" x2="80" y2="171"/>
    <line x1="100" y1="172" x2="100" y2="178"/>
    <line x1="115.5" y1="165.5" x2="120" y2="171"/>
  </g>
  <circle cx="100" cy="150" r="7" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
  <line x1="100" y1="150" x2="100" y2="55" stroke-width="2.4" style="stroke-width: max(2.4, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".9"/>
  <path d="M100,45 L106,58 L94,58 Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
</svg>
{%- elif nome == "arquitetura" -%}
<svg viewBox="39.6 39.1 120.9 120.9" style="--lado: 120.9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
  <circle cx="100" cy="150" r="7" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
  <polygon points="64,140 136,140 136,118 64,118" stroke-width="2" style="stroke-width: max(2, var(--min-u, 0))"/>
  <polygon points="76,118 124,118 124,88 76,88" stroke-width="2" style="stroke-width: max(2, var(--min-u, 0))"/>
  <polygon points="88,88 112,88 112,62 88,62" stroke-width="2" style="stroke-width: max(2, var(--min-u, 0))"/>
  <circle cx="100" cy="50" r="7" stroke-width="1.8" style="stroke-width: max(1.8, var(--min-u, 0))" opacity=".7"/>
  <path d="M100,57 C93,62 85,60 82,64" opacity=".6" stroke-width="1.6" style="stroke-width: max(1.6, var(--min-u, 0))"/>
</svg>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}
